      "headline": "In a troubling sign, Nvidia RTX 50 series prices jump up to 30% in South Korea — TSMC wafer hikes and $20 GDDR7 modules push RTX 5090 past $5,100",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "In a troubling sign, Nvidia RTX 50 series prices jump up to 30% in South Korea — TSMC wafer hikes and $20 GDDR7 modules push RTX 5090 past $5,100 Yet another blow for gamers.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975478+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "In a troubling sign, Nvidia RTX 50 series prices jump up to 30% in South Korea — TSMC wafer hikes and $20 GDDR7 modules push RTX 5090 past $5,100 Yet another blow for gamers.",
          "sentence_hash": "f89a983372229f2e28d62cf6c9631cb03705bc0d902b99f9c359c52944ef66e1",
          "anchors": [
            "$20 ",
            "30%",
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "According to a recent report, the price increase is primarily due to the recent increase in price for advanced process wafers from TSMC (Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company), along with the rising price for GDDR7 memory.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975525+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "According to a recent report, the price increase is primarily due to the recent increase in price for advanced process wafers from TSMC (Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company), along with the rising price for GDDR7 memory.",
          "sentence_hash": "cf9a4747bc9f8b4c891bb00a1c98f1a5bc5d0d12aefdfaec004f7314b4d4c68c",
          "anchors": [
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Perhaps most troubling is that, due to global market dynamics, pricing doesn't exist in a vacuum for any single region, suggesting that price hikes could be in store for other areas in the future.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975550+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "Perhaps most troubling is that, due to global market dynamics, pricing doesn't exist in a vacuum for any single region, suggesting that price hikes could be in store for other areas in the future.",
          "sentence_hash": "5b7d9c6935ff4660b930435e5b1495c443ac3528f2a78f8b50a1be0f26b7e454",
          "anchors": [
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "For context, TSMC recently asked its customers to prepare for price increases across its advanced chipmaking portfolio.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975569+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "For context, TSMC recently asked its customers to prepare for price increases across its advanced chipmaking portfolio.",
          "sentence_hash": "3a9db3119322a5217fb0f511fc82f593b129596f30c04351c26c197e67206a76",
          "anchors": [
            "fol",
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "ZDnet Korea’s report additionally cites market research firm TrendForce, claiming that GDDR7 2GB modules used in the RTX 50 series GPUs have increased to $20 per unit.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975596+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "ZDnet Korea’s report additionally cites market research firm TrendForce, claiming that GDDR7 2GB modules used in the RTX 50 series GPUs have increased to $20 per unit.",
          "sentence_hash": "959db94170c43a8427e83c832ac19dd018bb4201a19cbbc5d7097912971ebd7e",
          "anchors": [
            "$20 "
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "These board partners, thus, have little choice but to pass those higher costs on to consumers.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-04T08:03:47.975618+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "bdec5212263df5a522d5cf42137bef66f53ee1ea44f42a678423ba42cf123fa8",
          "excerpt": "These board partners, thus, have little choice but to pass those higher costs on to consumers.",
          "sentence_hash": "6e447428420e31355c9069df239e2299fd394eadaceb001af1e6ddea92cca94b",
